 "words": 239,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "There's a wedding up in Cana on the third day of the week",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The tables full of family and the music's at its peak",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the servants start to whisper and the steward starts to frown",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The wine is running out before the sun is going down",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His mother leans toward him, says they have no more wine",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He tells her that his hour has not yet come, not yet the time",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But she turns to the servants with a quiet knowing nod",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do whatever he tells you, and she leaves the rest to God",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have kept the good wine until now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Six stone jars filled to the brim somehow",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Water poured and wine came out",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You have kept the good wine until now",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fill the jars with water, so they fill them to the top",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now draw some out and take it, and they don't spill a drop",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The steward takes a sip of it and calls the bridegroom near",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone serves the good wine first, but the best is only here",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
